<title>SPAIN: Iberia swings back into profit for Jan-May.</title>
<headline>Iberia swings back into profit for Jan-May.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for first five months of 1997 in billions of pesetas, unless stated:</p>
<p> Pretax profit				1.23  vs 5.0 loss</p>
<p> Operating profit			   4.04  vs 6.35 profit</p>
<p>Note - Chairman Xabier Irala said drop in operating profit was due to the fact that costs remained high.</p>
<p>&quot;We have to continue working hard to control costs,&quot; he said.</p>
</text>
